Subject: [PATCH 1/2] launcher: theme the icons of the app drawer and group
 apps by category

launcher: theme the icons of the app drawer

Upstream themes only the workspace, folders and the taskbar, so the drawer stays in the apps' own colours. The drawer now follows the home screen's themed icons.

launcher: group apps by category

Pure logic: a category and a package name give one of eight groups; every app lands in exactly one group. Seven unit tests; six mutations of the logic each fail them.
